    "summary_insights": [
      "Revenue experienced exceptional growth of 123.1%, rising from £651,586 to over £1.45m.",
      "Gross margin compressed significantly from 56.7% to 43.1%, indicating that direct costs (particularly materials and subcontractors) grew faster than turnover.",
      "Despite margin compression, net profit increased by 306.6% to £111,111, driven by strong operational gearing as overheads did not scale at the same rate as revenue.",
      "Net profit margin improved from 4.2% to 7.6%, reflecting much better bottom-line efficiency in the current year.",
      "Interest coverage ratio improved dramatically from 13.7x to 102.1x, suggesting a very high level of financial resilience and low debt service risk.",
      "Staff-related costs (wages and pensions) increased by 28.6%, which is modest compared to the scale of revenue growth, contributing to the improved net margin.",
      "The company shows strong momentum with significant scaling of the business model and improved overall profitability."
